      </div>
      
      <div class="white-box">
        <button class="btn-blue" style="margin-bottom:15px;">POB/포스터 원재료 제외</button>
        
        <div class="form-group">
          <label>검색</label>
          <select class="form-select">
            <option>TXT 투모로우바이투게더 TOMORROW TOGETHER 두바두</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        
        <div class="form-group">
          <label>TITLE</label>
          <select class="form-select">
            <option>2026 시즌그리팅</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        
        <div class="form-group">
          <label>TYPE</label>
          <select class="form-select">
            <option>전체</option>
          </select>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 품목상세 -->
      <div class="section-header">
        <span>품목상세</span>
      </div>
      
      <div class="white-box">
        <div class="detail-actions">
          <div class="action-item">
            <div class="action-icon">🛒</div>
            <span>구매</span>
          </div>
          <div class="action-item">
            <div class="action-icon">➕</div>
            <span>SKU 추가</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.8; color: #666; margin-bottom: 15px;">
          <p>품목코드: </p>
          <p>전일재고일자: <span style="float:right">✈️</span></p>
          <p>RAW 임시재고(현재고+구매-판매): </p>
          <p>실재고: 미파악</p>
          <p>SKU 구매 - SKU 판매</p>
